    <h2>questions which you <i>might</i> want to hear answers to</h2>
		<h5>last updated: 17-nov-2025</h5>
    <p>Q: why does your website have this domain and why do pages look like this??<br>
		A: domain part: i saw .rip domain online one day and thought of ame (nso). i think they (.rip and ame) go together pretty well. and i find myself in ame and ame in myself.<br>
		graphics part: naturally followed from domain part, tried to be creative in trying to replicate parts of the game's ui through css but never got to reimplementing real windose. 
    </p>
			<p>Q: what are your hobbies/interests?<br>
			cooking. in my free time i play factorio and noita. i also like classical music, mostly concertos and suites (basically not piano/violin/other solos), notable picks that are on my daily rotation:<br>

				- Prokofiev piano concertos 1-3 and symphonies 1, 5<br>
				- Rachmaninoff piano concertos 1-4 and Flight of the Bumblebee arrangement for piano<br>
				- Handel's organ concertos 1-6 (to be honest they sound almost the same to me, i just like the organ)<br>
				- popular stuff like Rite of Spring, Firebird, Scheherazade (i fear i like oriental style a lot), Köçekçe<br>
				- popular stuff, cont., Swan Lake, Also sprach Zarathustra, 4 Seasons (not the Max Richter one! i prefer the original)<br>
				- Chopin's etudes and rondos and especially Fantaisie-Impromptu<br>
				- Liszt's etudes and 1st piano concerto (and other well-known stuff like Totentanz and Danse Macabre arrangement for piano)<br>
				- Holst's Planets suite<br>
			</p>
			<p>
        this concludes qa page, might add/remove entries in the future
    </p>
